# release zips built by tools/package.ps1
/dist/

# xrsim per-eye captures. `xrsim-shot.ps1 -Out name` (a bare name, no path)
# copies name_left.png / name_right.png / name_sbs.png / name.json into the
# CURRENT directory, which from the repo root means straight into the tree.
# The PNGs are rendered game frames, so committing one breaks the hard rule
# against game-derived content. Pass a path outside the repo, or rely on this.
/*_left.png
/*_right.png
/*_sbs.png
